WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.431
Choosing between a meditation retreat in person, or online?

00:00:04.581 --> 00:00:07.528
Here's what we've learned from running both.

00:00:08.178 --> 00:00:12.448
First, the question everyone asks. Does it work as well from home?

00:00:12.598 --> 00:00:18.477
Of the people who came to a retreat center, about fifty-eight in every hundred reached jhana.

00:00:18.627 --> 00:00:23.272
On our online retreat that fits around work, from home, about fifty-six.

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:29.225
That gap is smaller than the difference between one good week and another, in either format.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:34.762
And among people who'd never reached it before, the online group did slightly better.

00:00:35.412 --> 00:00:42.550
That's because it's the same retreat. Same exercises, same facilitators, same group sessions, same daily feedback.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:49.872
Jhana happens inside your own mind. What moves it is the practice and the feedback, not who's sitting next to you.

00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:54.575
What's different is the container. Who holds the space for you.

00:00:54.725 --> 00:01:03.507
At a retreat center, the place holds it. You leave your life behind, the meals are cooked, and a room full of people is doing the same thing.

00:01:03.657 --> 00:01:07.370
For a lot of people, that's the easiest way to go all in.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:12.329
At home, you hold it. That's harder in some ways, and it has its own upside.

00:01:12.479 --> 00:01:22.424
You learn it where you'll keep using it, with no jolt back to normal life. And some people find a familiar room easier to open up in than one full of strangers.

00:01:23.074 --> 00:01:29.771
Here's how the eleven days work. Two retreat weekends, Friday to Sunday, with ordinary workdays in between.

00:01:29.921 --> 00:01:37.210
You take two Fridays off. On the weekdays, you practice before and after work, and check in with a small group once.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.595
So it isn't an evenings thing. The weekends are full retreat days.

00:01:42.245 --> 00:01:47.973
So which one fits you? Ask yourself: would you be more distracted at home, or away from it?

00:01:48.123 --> 00:01:53.248
Can you protect two whole weekends? Will the people you live with give you room?

00:01:53.398 --> 00:02:04.058
If home is loud, or you know you'll check your email, come in person. Otherwise, we've found online works just as well, and it's a great option if you want the flexibility.

00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:07.800
If you've still got questions, we're always happy to talk it through.
